        <mxCell id="n-online-mode" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;The server runs &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;online-mode=false&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: it trusts Velocity&amp;#39;s forwarding secret. Velocity checks the Mojang session (view player-login).&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=10;fontColor=#94a3b8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
